{"id":106668,"docketId":1153250,"caseName":"Daniels v. Virginia","caseNameFull":"","slug":"daniels-v-virginia","docketNumber":"485 M","dateFiled":"1963-06-17","dateArgued":null,"dateCertGranted":null,"year":1963,"scdbId":"1962-157","direction":"Liberal","votesMajority":9,"votesMinority":0,"disposition":"","posture":"","syllabus":null,"summary":null,"headnotes":null,"proceduralHistory":null,"attorneys":null,"natureOfSuit":"","citationCount":2,"judges":"Per Curiam","jurisdictionType":"","opinions":[{"id":106668,"type":"majority","typeCode":"010combined","perCuriam":true,"author":"","joinedBy":"","pageCount":null,"textLength":1572,"isHtml":true,"text":"<div>\n<center><b><span class=\"citation\" data-id=\"8946627\"><a href=\"/opinion/8955644/daniels-v-virginia/\" aria-description=\"Citation for case: Daniels v. Virginia\">374 U.S. 500</a></span> (1963)</b></center>\n<center><h1>DANIELS ET AL.<br>\nv.<br>\nVIRGINIA.</h1></center>\n<center>No. 485, Misc.</center>\n<center><p><b>Supreme Court of United States.</b></p></center>\n<center>Decided June 17, 1963.</center>\nON PETITION FOR WRIT OF CERTIORARI TO THE SUPREME COURT OF APPEALS OF VIRGINIA.\n<p><i>Theodore J. St. Antoine</i> for petitioners.</p>\n<p>PER CURIAM.</p>\n<p>The motion for leave to proceed <i>in forma pauperis</i> and the petition for writ of certiorari are granted. The judgment is vacated and the case is remanded for further consideration in light of <i>Peterson</i> v. <i>City of Greenville,</i> <span class=\"citation\" data-id=\"9422598\"><a href=\"/opinion/106607/peterson-v-city-of-greenville/\" aria-description=\"Citation for case: Peterson v. City of Greenville\">373 U. S. 244</a></span>.</p>\n<p>MR. JUSTICE HARLAN concurs in the result on the premises stated in his separate opinion in <i>Peterson</i> v. <i><span class=\"citation\" data-id=\"9422598\"><a href=\"/opinion/106607/peterson-v-city-of-greenville/\" aria-description=\"Citation for case: Peterson v. City of Greenville\">City of Greenville</a></span></i> and <i>Avent</i> v. <i>North Carolina,</i> <span class=\"citation\" data-id=\"9422598\"><a href=\"/opinion/106607/peterson-v-city-of-greenville/#248\" aria-description=\"Citation for case: Peterson v. City of Greenville\">373 U. S., at 248</a></span>.</p>\n</div>"}],"citations":[]}